---
---
<section id="services" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#F9F9F9] border-b border-zinc-200 scroll-reveal">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-left max-w-3xl mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-sky-700 font-semibold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>Transparent Packaging · Zero Scope Creep</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">
        Sprints &amp; Async Retainers
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-600 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        No ambiguous hourly billing or 6-month agency contracts. Partner on a fixed-outcome sprint or subscribe to a dedicated async engineering queue you can pause or cancel anytime.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Flagship Retainer (Highlighted Ring) -->
    <div class="rounded-xl ring-2 ring-zinc-950 bg-white shadow-sm p-7 sm:p-10 mb-14 relative overflow-hidden interactive-card">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        <!-- Left details -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-950 text-white font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Most Popular · Monthly Retainer
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-700">
              ● 1 Slot Open for This Month
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">
            Fractional AI QA &amp; Accessibility Partner
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            A dedicated Senior SDET &amp; AI Quality Engineer embedded directly in your workflow. Submit unlimited test automation, flaky-test fixes, AI agent workflows, and WCAG accessibility tickets into a shared Linear queue.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 mt-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span><strong class="text-zinc-950">1 active task at a time</strong> (24-48h SLA)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span>Zero meetings: 100% async + 2-min Looms</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span>Continuous E2E &amp; WCAG gates on new PRs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span><strong class="text-zinc-950">Pause or cancel anytime</strong> (bank unused retainer days)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right pricing box (Dark Island) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-900 text-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white">$5,495</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium text-sm">/ month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-400 font-mono mt-1.5">Pilot rate: $4,495/mo for first 2 clients</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
              Replaces a $195,000 W-2 Senior SDET plus recruiting fees, equity, and benefits. Central Timezone (CST) overlap.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <a
              href="#book-call"
              class="w-full py-3 px-6 rounded-md font-bold text-center text-sm text-dark-900 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 block transition-colors shadow-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400"
            >
              Apply for a Retainer Slot
            </a>
            <span class="block text-center text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 mt-2.5">Shared Slack Connect + Linear access</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Fixed 21-Day Sprints (Horizontal 3-Column Grid) -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950">Fixed-Scope 21-Day Sprints</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600">Guaranteed deliverables · Zero long-term commitment</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Sprint A -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between interactive-card">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Sprint A</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">3-Week Delivery</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 leading-snug mb-3">
              AI-Ready Playwright Foundation
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Production Playwright + TypeScript architecture built from scratch. API session state caching (&lt;50ms), top 15 critical user journeys automated, parallelized GitHub Actions CI (&lt;3 min), and custom Cursor / Claude rules for your dev team.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 font-mono">$5,500</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">Fixed Scope</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="#book-call"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 border border-zinc-300 bg-white hover:border-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              Book Sprint
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sprint B -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between interactive-card">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Sprint B</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">3-Week Delivery</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 leading-snug mb-3">
              Legacy Framework Migration (Selenium / Cypress -&gt; Playwright)
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Zero-downtime dual-run CI cutover. We convert 25-35 critical paths from brittle legacy Selenium or Cypress to Playwright + TypeScript, replace fragile XPaths with accessible locators, and slash CI runtimes by 60%+.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 font-mono">$6,500</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">Fixed Scope</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="#book-call"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 border border-zinc-300 bg-white hover:border-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              Book Sprint
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sprint C -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50/40 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between interactive-card">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Sprint C · Compliance</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">3-Week Delivery</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 leading-snug mb-3">
              WCAG 2.1 AA Frontend Migration &amp; CI Automation
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
              Hands-on frontend accessibility remediation (semantic DOM, ARIA states, keyboard traps, focus restoration) + automated @axe-core and VoiceOver regression gates in CI. Prepares your product for VPAT 2.5 filings.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 font-mono">$7,500</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">Fixed Scope</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="#book-call"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              Book Sprint
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The 48-Hour Diagnostic Wedge -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 interactive-card">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Low-Risk Diagnostic</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-700 font-semibold">· 100% credited toward any sprint</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950">48-Hour Test Velocity &amp; WCAG Risk Audit</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Not ready for a full sprint? I will inspect your repo and deliver a 20-minute video diagnostic covering flaky selectors, CI bottlenecks, and WCAG AA violation hotspots + a 30-day action plan in 48 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 flex-shrink-0 self-end md:self-center">
        <div class="text-right">
          <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 font-mono">$950</span>
          <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">Fixed Fee</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#book-call"
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md font-semibold text-xs text-white bg-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Order 48-Hr Audit
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
